       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. POLICY01.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY POLICY.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "POLICY INQUIRY".
